  "releaseNotes": "Fixed issue with fallback font with PostScript outlines resulting in large PDF size.\nFixed issue with multithreading race condition when saving to images in WPF.\nFixed issue with duplicating images when printing.\nAdded support for PKCS#11 context-specific authentication with PdfPkcs11DigitalId.Pin.\nFixed issue with embedded font that doesn't have 'glyf' table.",
